{"content":[{"c":["BERECHIAH* "],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Son of Zerubbabel and descendant of King David (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.3.20","r":"1Chr.3.20","rawR":"1Chr.3.20","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.3.20","value":"1Chr.3.20"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 3:20"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Levite, Gershon’s descendant and father of Asaph (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.6.39","r":"1Chr.6.39","rawR":"1Chr.6.39","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.6.39","value":"1Chr.6.39"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 6:39"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.15.17","r":"1Chr.15.17","rawR":"1Chr.15.17","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.15.17","value":"1Chr.15.17"}],"t":"ref","v":"15:17"},"). Asaph was a famous musician of Israel."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["3. Asa’s son and head of a family of Levites who returned to Judah after the Babylonian exile (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.9.16","r":"1Chr.9.16","rawR":"1Chr.9.16","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.9.16","value":"1Chr.9.16"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 9:16"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["4. Levite appointed by King David as gatekeeper for the ark of the covenant (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.15.23","r":"1Chr.15.23","rawR":"1Chr.15.23","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.15.23","value":"1Chr.15.23"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 15:23"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["5. Meshillemoth’s son, a leader of Ephraim’s tribe. He was one of three men in Samaria who supported the prophet Obed in sending prisoners of war back to their homes in Judah (",{"href":"?bref=2Chr.28.12","r":"2Chr.28.12","rawR":"2Chr.28.12","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Chr.28.12","value":"2Chr.28.12"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Chr 28:12"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["6. Meshullam’s father. Meshullam assisted Nehemiah, the governor, in rebuilding the wall of Jerusalem (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.3.4,30","r":"Neh.3.4,30","rawR":"Neh.3.4,30","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.3.4,30","value":"Neh.3.4,30"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 3:4, 30"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Neh.6.18","r":"Neh.6.18","rawR":"Neh.6.18","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.6.18","value":"Neh.6.18"}],"t":"ref","v":"6:18"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["7. Iddo’s son and father of Zechariah the prophet (",{"href":"?bref=Zech.1.1,7","r":"Zech.1.1,7","rawR":"Zech.1.1,7","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Zech.1.1,7","value":"Zech.1.1,7"}],"t":"ref","v":"Zec 1:1, 7"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":[{"c":["See also"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=BarachiahBarachias_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"BarachiahBarachias_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"BarachiahBarachias_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Barachiah, Barachias"},"."],"sourceClass":"sp","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Berechiah","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"1 Chr 3:20","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.3.20","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.3.20","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.3.20"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 6:39","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.6.39","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.6.39","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.6.39"},{"anchorText":"15:17","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.15.17","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.15.17","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.15.17"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 9:16","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.9.16","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.9.16","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.9.16"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 15:23","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.15.23","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.15.23","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.15.23"},{"anchorText":"2 Chr 28:12","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Chr.28.12","rawQueryValue":"2Chr.28.12","sourceRefExact":"2Chr.28.12"},{"anchorText":"Neh 3:4, 30","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dicti